Day 72 - picoCTF: First Find (General Skills - Easy)

Challenge involved searching through a large zip file containing book files to find a hidden flag.

Solved it using GUI file explorer first, then practiced the same using Linux commands:
cd into directories, ls to list files, cat to read file contents.

Faster approach for next time:
grep -r "picoCTF" . 
This searches recursively through all files in one command instead of manually navigating.

Flag found and submitted successfully.
